    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "On 31.01.2025, this matter was heard and the learned counsel for the petitioner argued the case.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1184,
      "end": 1280,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "31.01.2025",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1187,
          "end": 1197
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "The learned Public Prosecutor was also heard and the case was reserved for orders.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1281,
      "end": 1363,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "However, on going through the records, it was found that a lawyer was engaged by the 2nd respondent and the counsel on record did not appear on 31.01.2025.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1364,
      "end": 1519,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "31.01.2025",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1508,
          "end": 1518
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "As the allegations involved serious offences, including an offence under Section 376 of IPC, it is appropriate that the High Court Legal Services Committee assign a lawyer to represent the 2 nd respondent in this matter.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1520,
      "end": 1740,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 376",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1593,
          "end": 1604
        },
        {
          "text": "IPC",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1608,
          "end": 1611
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "Registry shall take appropriate steps in this regard.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1741,
      "end": 1794,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
